---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>Welcome to My Blog!</h1>
			<p>
				Hello! I am building this space using Astro and Cloudflare Workers to share my journey, 
				ideas, and development projects. 
			</p>
			<p>
				This site serves as a lightweight, clean corner of the internet where I can document what I learn 
				and write about tech, design, and everything in between.
			</p>
			
			<h2>What you'll find here:</h2>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Articles & Insights:</strong> Thoughts on web infrastructure, front-end development, and serverless workflows.</li>
				<li><strong>Project Devlogs:</strong> Behind-the-scenes logs of things I am actively designing and launching.</li>
				<li><strong>Personal Musings:</strong> A space to write down thoughts on creative processes and continuous learning.</li>
			</ul>
			
			<p>
				Stay tuned as I add more content, polish up the layouts, and expand this platform. Thanks for dropping by!
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
